{
  "id": 330000100,
  "name": "Scar: Lightbane Reversal",
  "desc": "One of the Fractsidus Overseers. His blazing inferno engulfs all order and rules, leaving chaos in its wake.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Fire>Fusion DMG</color> while in human form. \nWhen enraged, he transforms into a grim goat reaper with a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> and <color=Dark>Havoc DMG</color>.\n\nOne of the Fractsidus Overseers.\n\nA rebel who revels in Overclocking, disregarding the ideas of beauty and order. He enjoys destruction and chaos, delighting in the suffering of others. He disregards rules and fame, using any means to reach his goals. With an introspective sobriety driving him, he seeks you out to witness the birth of a new world, still in its infancy.\n\n<i>\"New life blooms from scorched earth, rising through the ashes.\"</i>",
  "rarity": 3,
  "element": 2,
